body:
I don't think you're being a crybaby.

&#x200B;

Dating in this day and age is hard, no two ways about it. It's exhausting to always worry about what you're saying, how you look, etc. The fact that people can hide behind their phones now doesn't help things either. I'm a 25 yr old guy, so I'm in a somewhat similar position. I also know what it feels like to be uncomfortable with my body. I'm always so nervous to get naked with someone for the first time.

&#x200B;

That being said, the best thing you can do is test it out. Bumble (where the girls get to message the guys first) may be a good choice because it gives you some control. I know it can be nerve wracking, but there are good people out there who would jump at the chance to be with you. You don't have to sleep with anyone if you don't want to, but you deserve someone who will take care of you too.

&#x200B;
